<title>USA: Zytec names Kamm president, COO.</title>
<headline>Zytec names Kamm president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zytec Corp said Monday its board of directors named Ervin Kamm Jr as president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Kamm was named to Zytec's board in December 1996 and president of power conversion operations in March 1997. Prior to joining Zytec, Kamm served two years as president and chief executive of Digi International Inc, the company said.  </p>
<p>The chief operating officer position is newly created, a Zytec spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Zytec provides custom electronic power conversion equipment.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
